# Mechanical Structure  
# 机械结构

## 1. Components  
- 定子铁芯  
- 多相绕组  
- 永磁转子或鼠笼转子  
- 轴承  
- 散热结构  
- 外壳  

- Stator core  
- Multi‑phase windings  
- Permanent‑magnet or squirrel‑cage rotor  
- Bearings  
- Cooling structure  
- Housing  

## 2. Design Notes  
- 定子槽形需适配多相绕组  
- 转子磁钢需耐高温  
- 轴承需支持高速  
- 外壳需良好散热  

- Stator slots must support multi‑phase coils  
- Rotor magnets must be high‑temperature grade  
- Bearings must support high speed  
- Housing must provide good cooling  

## 3. Recommended Materials  
- 定子：硅钢片 35WW300  
- 磁钢：N35SH / N38SH  
- 轴承：6203/6204  
- 外壳：铝合金 6061  

- Stator: 35WW300 silicon steel  
- Magnets: N35SH / N38SH  
- Bearings: 6203/6204  
- Housing: Aluminum 6061  

## 4. Prototype Dimensions  
- 定子外径：80–120 mm  
- 转子外径：50–90 mm  
- 轴径：10–14 mm  
- 气隙：0.3–0.6 mm  

- Stator OD: 80–120 mm  
- Rotor OD: 50–90 mm  
- Shaft: 10–14 mm  
- Air gap: 0.3–0.6 mm  

## 5. CAD Suggestions  
- 使用 Fusion 360 / SolidWorks  
- 采用模块化结构  

- Use Fusion 360 / SolidWorks  
- Prefer modular design